allions with spaetzle and vegetables\n\n# Turkey\nTurkey cream schnitzel | 21,90 | with spaetzle and salad\n\n# Beef\nBraised ox cheeks | 28,90 | with spaetzle and salad\nBeef roast with onions | 32,90 | with fried potatoes and salad\nArgentinian rump steak | 30,90 | with herb butter, fried potatoes and salad\n\u201cMadagascar\u201d pepper steak | 34,90 | with fried potatoes and salad\n\n# Sides\nPortion of vegetables | 6,50\nPortion of fried potatoes | 6,50\nPortion of spaetzle | 6,50\nPortion of spaetzle with sauce | 7,50\n\n# For our little guests\nSpaetzle with gravy | 7,50\nTwo maultaschen | 10,90 | with a little salad\nCheese spaetzle | 10,90 | with a little salad\n\n# Dessert\nRed berry compote | 6,90 | with vanilla sauce\nTiramisu | 7,90\nChocolate mousse | 7,90\nSlice of apple cake | 5,40\nSlice of apple cake with cream | 5,90\n\n# Snacks\nPortion of olives | 7,90\n\u201cK\u00e4sesch\u00fctte\u201d | 13,90 | diced cheese, generously garnished, with bread\nSausage salad | 14,90 | with bread\nAlsatian sausage salad | 13,90 | with cheese and bread\nAlsatian Munster cheese | 14,90 | with bread\nFarmer\u2019s sausages | 13,90 | with bread\nBlack Forest bacon ham | 13,90 | with bread","tr":"# \u00c7orbalar & Ba\u015flang\u0131\u00e7lar\nDomates kremal\u0131 \u00e7orba | 7,90 | peynir kapakl\u0131\nMaultaschen \u00e7orbas\u0131 | 8,40\nBaden usul\u00fc salyangoz tavas\u0131 | 12,90 | yar\u0131m d\u00fczine ba\u011f salyangozu\n\n# Salatalar\nKar\u0131\u015f\u0131k yan salata | 6,90\nB\u00fcy\u00fck kar\u0131\u015f\u0131k salata taba\u011f\u0131 | 14,90\n\u201cEl Grecco\u201d salatas\u0131 | 19,90 | beyaz peynirli, zeytinli ve biberli Yunan \u00e7oban salatas\u0131\n\u201cCalifornia\u201d salatas\u0131 | 21,90 | hindi \u015fnitzel ve otlu tereya\u011f\u0131 ile\nSalata taba\u011f\u0131 | 21,90 | f\u00fcme somon ile\nFilet Mignon | 22,90 | tost \u00fczerinde domuz bonfile, salatalarla \u00e7evrili\n\n# Ana yemekler\nSebzeli patates graten | 16,90 | vejetaryen\nFreib